  "name": "breast-imaging-reference-coded-concepts",
  "notes": [
    "Generated by tools/generate_breast_descriptor_map.py; do not edit by hand.",
    "Every entry maps a standard value to itself.",
    "CID 4005 gives Partial View Code Sequence (0028,1352) values. The Purpose of Reference groups give Purpose of Reference Code Sequence (0040,A170) values in each context where it occurs, such as Source Image, Referenced Image, Related Series and Contributing Equipment Sequences. CID 7003 applies to report references and has a UMLS row. CID 7203 gives Derivation Code Sequence (0008,9215) values.",
    "SCT values come from the Code Value column. SRT values come from the SNOMED-RT ID column of the same rows, where a group has that column.",
    "Code Meaning values match the CID text exactly.",
    "Mappings apply to the tag at every nesting level, not only in these sequences."
  ],
